26-10-25T05:18:41.3705157\u002B00:00","mapId":"大地图"},{"id":1093,"kind":"operation","message":"使用物品：物品编号 1，targetId participant_1_钟灵","notice":false,"time":"2026-10-25T05:18:41.3724188\u002B00:00","mapId":"大地图"},{"id":1094,"kind":"battle","message":"李文秀休息调息。","notice":false,"time":"2026-10-25T05:18:41.3901849\u002B00:00","mapId":"大地图"},{"id":1095,"kind":"battle","message":"钟灵受到 149 点伤害。","notice":false,"time":"2026-10-25T05:18:41.3954745\u002B00:00","mapId":"大地图"},{"id":1096,"kind":"battle","message":"瓦耳拉齐受到 48 点伤害。","notice":false,"time":"2026-10-25T05:18:41.4146676\u002B00:00","mapId":"大地图"},{"id":1097,"kind":"battle","message":"Wren施展「野球拳」。","notice":false,"time":"2026-10-25T05:18:41.4146731\u002B00:00","mapId":"大地图"},{"id":1098,"kind":"growth","message":"钟灵从5级升至6级。","notice":true,"time":"2026-10-25T05:18:41.4162611\u002B00:00","mapId":"大地图"},{"id":1099,"kind":"item","message":"获得「大蟠桃」×1","notice":true,"time":"2026-10-25T05:18:41.4170533\u002B00:00","mapId":"大地图"},{"id":1100,"kind":"battle","message":"战斗胜利，已按原有规则结算经验和掉落。","notice":false,"time":"2026-10-25T05:18:41.4170883\u002B00:00","mapId":"大地图"},{"id":1101,"kind":"operation","message":"施展招式：武功 野球拳，x 4，y 2","notice":false,"time":"2026-10-25T05:18:41.4171321\u002B00:00","mapId":"大地图"},{"id":1102,"kind":"dialogue","message":"李文秀：Gines. You told the knight this camp was a prison.","notice":false,"time":"2026-10-25T05:18:41.4316517\u002B00:00","mapId":"大地图"},{"id":1103,"kind":"operation","message":"离开战斗","notice":false,"time":"2026-10-25T05:18:41.4317038\u002B00:00","mapId":"大地图"},{"id":1104,"kind":"dialogue","message":"瓦耳拉齐：He wanted someone to rescue. I merely supplied a location.","notice":false,"time":"2026-10-25T05:18:41.4461211\u002B00:00","mapId":"大地图"},{"id":1105,"kind":"dialogue","message":"李文秀：And a story that let your men carry away our food.","notice":false,"time":"2026-10-25T05:18:41.4560338\u002B00:00","mapId":"大地图"},{"id":1106,"kind":"dialogue","message":"瓦耳拉齐：A good story opens more doors than a good lockpick.","notice":false,"time":"2026-10-25T05:18:41.4665990\u002B00:00","mapId":"大地图"},{"id":1107,"kind":"dialogue","message":"主角：Then you can tell it to the guards. Father Perez has gone to fetch them.","notice":false,"time":"2026-10-25T05:18:41.4800186\u002B00:00","mapId":"大地图"},{"id":1108,"kind":"dialogue","message":"李文秀：We\u0027ll get the wagons home. No giants required.","notice":false,"time":"2026-10-25T05:18:41.4928996\u002B00:00","mapId":"大地图"},{"id":1109,"kind":"dialogue","message":"李文秀：The wagons are heading home. The knight is helping mend the fence he broke.","notice":false,"time":"2026-10-25T05:18:41.5058080\u002B00:00","mapId":"大地图"},{"id":1110,"kind":"dialogue","message":"主角：How is the fence taking his apology?","notice":false,"time":"2026-10-25T05:18:41.5169309\u002B00:00","mapId":"大地图"},{"id":1111,"kind":"dialogue","message":"李文秀：Better than the chickens. I\u0027d like to travel with you. We work well together.","notice":false,"time":"2026-10-25T05:18:41.5301873\u002B00:00","mapId":"大地图"},{"id":1112,"kind":"dialogue","message":"主角：Then we\u0027ll keep learning. One road and one battle at a time.","notice":false,"time":"2026-10-25T05:18:41.5422442\u002B00:00","mapId":"大地图"},{"id":1113,"kind":"dialogue","message":"李文秀：There was a Bloodthorn Bolt tome in the stolen crate. We can study it. The trainer can explain the notes; Gines mostly drew skulls.","notice":false,"time":"2026-10-25T05:18:41.5541610\u002B00:00","mapId":"大地图"},{"id":1114,"kind":"dialogue","message":"主角：So that\u0027s where he gets his big ideas.","notice":false,"time":"2026-10-25T05:18:41.5665029\u002B00:00","mapId":"大地图"},{"id":1115,"kind":"notice","message":"李文秀 自由属性点 \u002B30","notice":true,"time":"2026-10-25T05:18:41.5792361\u002B00:00","mapId":"大地图"},{"id":1116,"kind":"notice","message":"李文秀 奇门 \u002B40","notice":true,"time":"2026-10-25T05:18:41.5795933\u002B00:00","mapId":"大地图"},{"id":1117,"kind":"notice","message":"李文秀 max_hp \u002B500","notice":true,"time":"2026-10-25T05:18:41.5800755\u002B00:00","mapId":"大地图"},{"id":1118,"kind":"notice","message":"李文秀 max_mp \u002B500","notice":true,"time":"2026-10-25T05:18:41.5801143\u002B00:00","mapId":"大地图"},{"id":1119,"kind":"item","message":"获得「黑血神针秘籍」×1","notice":true,"time":"2026-10-25T05:18:41.5804097\u002B00:00","mapId":"大地图"},{"id":1120,"kind":"growth","message":"解锁称号：白马西风","notice":true,"time":"2026-10-25T05:18:41.5813255\u002B00:00","mapId":"大地图"},{"id":1121,"kind":"notice","message":"李文秀 习得外功【黑血神针】 1级","notice":true,"time":"2026-10-25T05:18:41.6136960\u002B00:00","mapId":"大地图"},{"id":1122,"kind":"story","message":"已选择修炼秘籍「黑血神针秘籍」。秘籍保留在背包，战斗结算经验将用于此项修炼。","notice":false,"time":"2026-10-25T05:18:41.6139184\u002B00:00","mapId":"大地图"},{"id":1123,"kind":"operation","message":"选择修炼秘籍：物品编号 10","notice":false,"time":"2026-10-25T05:18:41.6141787\u002B00:00","mapId":"大地图"},{"id":1124,"kind":"story","message":"已切换当前运行内功。","notice":false,"time":"2026-10-25T05:18:41.6249213\u002B00:00","mapId":"大地图"},{"id":1125,"kind":"operation","message":"切换主运内功：武功 基本内功","notice":false,"time":"2026-10-25T05:18:41.6253053\u002B00:00","mapId":"大地图"},{"id":1126,"kind":"operation","message":"调整参战顺序：人物 李文秀，选项 1","notice":false,"time":"2026-10-25T05:18:41.6373065\u002B00:00","mapId":"大地图"},{"id":1127,"kind":"operation","message":"与地点交互：地点 南贤居","notice":false,"time":"2026-10-25T05:18:41.6476755\u002B00:00","mapId":"南贤居"},{"id":1128,"kind":"dialogue","message":"主角：Time to practice together. If we both shout \u0027I\u0027ve got this\u0027, one of us still needs to watch the flank.","notice":false,"time":"2026-10-25T05:18:41.6590978\u002B00:00","mapId":"南贤居"},{"id":1129,"kind":"operation","message":"与地点交互：地点 结伴练习","notice":false,"time":"2026-10-25T05:18:41.6591649\u002B00:00","mapId":"南贤居"},{"id":1130,"kind":"battle","message":"进入战斗：结伴练习。","notice":false,"time":"2026-10-25T05:18:41.6687086\u002B00:00","mapId":"南贤居"},{"id":1131,"kind":"operation","message":"战场走位：x 4，y 1","notice":false,"time":"2026-10-25T05:18:41.7085467\u002B00